{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bumper Brawlers is a game where you choose your vehicle and battle to have the highest score or be the last one standing - depending on the game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879110/extras/344dd67e62c36056fd8f39ff9949e49a.poster.avif?t=1763520132\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879110/extras/344dd67e62c36056fd8f39ff9949e49a.webm?t=1763520132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879110/extras/344dd67e62c36056fd8f39ff9949e49a.mp4?t=1763520132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SINGLE + LOCAL-MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bots allow you to play by yourself, where the game really comes into it's own is when you're playing with friends in split screen carnage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last vehicle standing - Damage your enemies by hitting into them, using the arena or your special weapon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score - you earn more score the more damage and tricks you force your enemies to do</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARENAS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six arenas, each with it's own setting and featuring a unique way to destroy your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WEAPONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapons are available, each one is simple to use and has a unique way to cause problems for your enemies.</p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3879110?t=1763520132","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3879110?t=176352